OL,3,AUS too focused on Middle East and not  
OL,4,Apushing Russia hard enough, Zelensky   
OL,5,Atells BBC                              
OL,7,FVolodymyr Zelensky has voiced deep     
OL,8,Ffrustration with the US, saying delays 
OL,9,Fin delivering vital anti-ballistic     
OL,10,Fmissiles are costing Ukrainian lives   
OL,11,Fand complaining that the US is not     
OL,12,Fpushing Russia hard enough in peace    
OL,13,Ftalks.                                 
OL,15,FIn an interview with the BBC at his    
OL,16,Fcentral Kyiv office, Ukraine's         
OL,17,Fpresident also said it was "strange"   
OL,18,Fthat Donald Trump had posted a photo of
OL,19,Fhimself embracing Vladimir Putin as "my
OL,20,Ffriend".                               
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
