OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS too focused on Middle East and not  
OL,4,Apushing Russia hard enough, Zelensky   
OL,5,Atells BBC                              
OL,7,F"Of course it's up to the President of 
OL,8,Fthe United States, but... it's         
OL,9,Fstrange," Zelensky said, speaking in   
OL,10,FEnglish.                               
OL,12,F"He's an aggressor, and a killer...He  
OL,13,Fcan't be a friend. Just cannot be," he 
OL,14,Fsaid, adding it was like saying you    
OL,15,Fwere friends with Adolf Hitler during  
OL,16,FWorld War Two.                         
